    {
      "id": "1z76m4f",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Key Legal & Administrative Changes Introduced by the Reorganisation"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "J&K UT possesses a Legislative Assembly provisions under Article 239A, similar to Puducherry, whereas Ladakh is a UT without a legislature.",
        "The official appointed date for the enforcement of the reorganisation was 31st October 2019 (National Unity Day).",
        "Parliamentary representation allocates 5 Lok Sabha seats and 4 Rajya Sabha seats to J&K UT, while Ladakh gets 1 Lok Sabha seat and 0 Rajya Sabha seats."
      ],
      "id": "ga5x2f7"
